{"_id":"6a7edb4944be5d26d86e7c2a","id":"Stephen3zero24/amap-2000-candidates-v1","author":"Stephen3zero24","sha":"e2ac32830f66624eb492fb40cfbc90928e8e5b69","lastModified":"2026-08-17T02:53:06.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["language:zh","size_categories:n<1K","format:json","modality:tabular","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","synthetic","gui-agent","mock-app","candidate-trajectories"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAmap 2,000 Deterministic Mock App Candidate Trajectories v1\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t数据集摘要\n\t\n\n这是一个公开的、确定性生成的 MobileGym-Harmony 高德 Mock App 候选轨迹实验包。它包含 2,000 条候选轨迹，范围固定为 candidate_experiment_only，验收状态为 pass_with_non_promotion_boundary。\n本包不是正式交付包，不是真实模型 rollout，不是真实高德采集，也没有证明这些数据适合训练或评测模型。\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t两条冻结链路\n\t\n\n\nchain_1_route_mode：针对目标地点查看步行、骑行、驾车或公交路线；四种模式各 250 条，共 1,000 条。\nchain_2_nearest_compare：在最近 N 个候选中，按最高评分或最低价格进行选择，再查看步行或骑行路线；四个交叉组合各 250 条，共 1,000 条。\n\n显式投影与上下文投影各 1,000 条。所有轨迹均来自确定性的本地… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Stephen3zero24/amap-2000-candidates-v1.","downloads":47,"likes":0,"cardData":{"pretty_name":"Amap 2,000 Deterministic Mock App Candidate Trajectories v1","language":["zh"],"size_categories":["1K<n<10K"],"tags":["synthetic","gui-agent","mock-app","candidate-trajectories"]},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"PUBLICATION-SAFETY.md"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"RELEASE-MANIFEST.json"},{"rfilename":"checksums/CONTENT-SHA256SUMS"},{"rfilename":"checksums/SHA256SUMS"},{"rfilename":"data/trajectories-000001-000250.tar.gz"},{"rfilename":"data/trajectories-000251-000500.tar.gz"},{"rfilename":"data/trajectories-000501-000750.tar.gz"},{"rfilename":"data/trajectories-000751-001000.tar.gz"},{"rfilename":"data/trajectories-001001-001250.tar.gz"},{"rfilename":"data/trajectories-001251-001500.tar.gz"},{"rfilename":"data/trajectories-00150